    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Afro-Belgian 3D illustrator and animator (Blender); vibrant hyper-feminine digital worlds exploring identity, mental health and the African-diaspora narrative (Creative Review, Its Nice That, Pictoplasma). Clients include BMW, Adobe, Burning Man, The New Yorker; animations aired on MTV and Adult Swim; named a Giphy Animator to Watch 2021. Based in Belgium (born Sint-Niklaas 1993). Freelance per her LinkedIn (\"Freelance\") and self-run portfolio. Mid-level independent artist with a strong commissioned client roster (Autonomy 4, inferred from solo-authored client work, no first-hand evidence). Work captured across 6 projects: Adult Swim Idents, MTV Ident, BMW China (Chinese New Year 2022), Focket Fyre: Skate or Die (WarnerMedia), Fall in Love with Learning (Apple, 2024), ID Tuca and Bertie (Adult Swim, 2023); plus YouTube embed for LLusion x Cautious Clay lyric video. Instagram context shot blocked by headless Playwright login wall; queued to state/ig-queue.json for logged-in ig.py grab. Site uses self-hosted HTML5 video (no YouTube/Vimeo iframes available to embed for project videos).",
